<!-- | Feature/Gaps           | Status    | Technical Observation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| **Register Map**       | **FULL**  | Populated based on `pdm_reg.h`. Defines controls for PDM/ADC audio input channels, filtering, volume, and the RX FIFO.                                                                                                                                                                |
| **Base Address**       | **Complex**| Based on `bl808.h` (`AUDIO_BASE` 0x20055000) and header offsets (`0xC00`). The peripheral name should be PDM, and the base address should be derived from the largest consecutive block, though for PAC generation, the offset values must be used. We use 0x20055000 as base and shift. |
| **ADC Channels**       | **FULL**  | Supports three independent ADC channels (0, 1, 2) with individual enable, FIR mode, scaling (`_scal`), and K1/K2 dynamic filtering.                                                                                                                                                   |
| **Clocking/Rate**      | **FULL**  | Includes global clock gating (`audio_ckg_en`) and `adc_rate` settings (0xC00).                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| **FIFO Management**    | **FULL**  | Detailed RX FIFO control (`rx_fifo_ctrl`) including flush, DMA request settings, threshold, and data width (`rx_data_res`).                                                                                                                                                            |
| **Volume Control**     | **FULL**  | Separate registers (`pdm_adc_s0-s2`) for independent digital volume scaling on each of the three ADC input streams.                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Reset Values**       | Added     | Reset values for all fields integrated from the `struct pdm_reg` bitfield annotations.                                                                                                                                                                                               |
-->
